            "review_title": "Review at Ashima Mushroom Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Chefsteps1\nBrisbane, Australia36 contributions\n0\nWorst place I've been to in vietnam\nSep 2022 • Friends\nThe worst food for the price , we order teriyaki beef and comes uncut ,and then the destroys the meat with a pair of scissors. The strawberry juice comes out with an old rosemary sprig and makes it tastes only of rosemary. This food is really crap. People need to eat good food before they try the restaurants in vietnam because 99% of them are sh-t. Like this one. We get the bill and they added more tax to the bill, you have a price on the menu and you see it change once you order it, they say it's tax ,so why at the end of the bill you get another Vat added . The place is disgraceful and stealing money from customers. It's time Vietnamese restaurants like this one start being made accountable for there lies and poor food.\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2022",
