            "review_title": "Review at Ashima Mushroom Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Nhu_Phuong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam292 contributions\n0\nPleasant!\nMay 2018 • Business\nThe first praise for this particular branch must be the staff. They were extremely accommodating while our group could be a tiny bit demanding. \nI love mushroom so no reason not to love the food here. Our table ordered vegetarian hot pot and it was very good. If the vegetarian option was that good, I suppose the meat-based broth should be superb as well. \nThe restaurant itself was a charming and pleasant place. It definitely felt welcoming. \nConsidering the price, I'd say it's a restaurant for special occasions, not really a place for your every day meals. Highly recommended though!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 28, 2018",
