            "review_title": "Review at Ashima Mushroom Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Jung112\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam118 contributions\n0\nBest hot pot in Saigon\nApr 2018 • Family\nI really enjoy the hot pot here. The concept is so unique and unexpected. The variety of mushrooms is tremendous and the service is excellent. I normally order American beef and 4-5 half orders of differing mushrooms. You can also get seafood as well as other land creatures. I also add a few vegetables and tofu skin. The soup has such an intense and warming umami. When you feel a bit depressed or sick, I always come here to get recharged.\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2018",
